sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Inventory camera draft and commit implemented on server
    accDescr: Gateway behavior is the intended contract, Worker, D1, R2 and Gemini orchestration are implemented. Draft and commit use separate UUID v4 idempotency keys.
    participant C as C0 / gateway client design
    participant S as Hono Worker
    participant D as D1 receipts and inventory
    participant G as Gemini
    participant R as Private R2
    participant W as FridgeRoom
    C->>S: POST checkin/draft - Bearer, JPEG, Idempotency-Key
    S->>D: Claim draft operation and inference quota
    alt Existing matching completed draft
        D-->>S: Cached response
    else New draft
        S->>G: Classify food with bilingual structured output
        G-->>S: Food flag, confidence, category and expiry
        Note over S,G: Reject unidentifiable images, do not create inventory
        S->>R: Save immutable tenant-scoped JPEG
        S->>D: Store completed draft receipt
    end
    S-->>C: Draft metadata and private image storage path
    Note over C: User reviews expiry, intended LCD auto-confirm flow
    C->>S: POST checkin - confirmed fields and new Idempotency-Key
    S->>D: Atomically insert inventory and commit receipt
    S->>W: Broadcast inventory_changed after commit
    S-->>C: Created item or matching prior outcome
    C->>S: POST checkout/draft - JPEG and Idempotency-Key
    S->>D: Read current inventory and claim draft
    S->>G: Match photo against current inventory candidates
    G-->>S: Candidate IDs and confidence
    Note over S,D: Filter unknown IDs, order candidates by FEFO
    S-->>C: Ranked real inventory items, no inventory mutation
    C->>S: POST checkout - confirmed item_id
    S->>D: Delete selected inventory item
    S->>R: Retire photo only after last inventory reference
    S->>W: Broadcast inventory_changed
    S-->>C: Checkout result
